      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-02-013\" hidden></div>\n<h2 class=\"mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3035]\" style=\"background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>7. MANAGEMENT OF INFERTILE COUPLE</strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3036]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3037]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Additional Tests:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Anovulation \u2013 Androgen + pituita</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ry.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Male factor.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>FSH, LH, Testo</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>sterone</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Keryo, CF, Y \u2013 microdeletion.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Safety tests </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>SCD, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>HIV</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, hepatitis.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Baseline tests</strong></u></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3038]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Semen analysis</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3039]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pelvic Anatomy TVS</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3040]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ovulation (midluteal</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> P, cycle length).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3041]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ovarian Reserve.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3042]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CT</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, Rubella/</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3043]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hyc</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>osy/lapro/HSG in selected</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3044]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cases </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u2013 if suspicion of tubal diseas</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>e.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3045]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3046]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Male factor</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>20 -30%</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>IVF:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Treatment of choice</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>IUI or Donor insemination DI</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Sigle</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> women \u2013 DI</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>-erectile/ejaculation problem.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>HIV</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- azo</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>ospermia</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Surgery:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- reversal of vasectomy </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- o</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>bstructive AZO</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3047]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Female factor</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>30 \u2013 50%</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Anovulation</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>11 30%</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>OI:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- CC</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- FSH</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- GnRH A</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- FSH \u2013 </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>- Ovarian Drilling if resistant to OI.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>unexplained</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3048]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>25 \u2013 30%</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3049]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3050]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>Endometriosis 5 \u2013 10%:</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>IVF</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>- Treatment of choice</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>- mod \u2013 severe disease</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>GnRH A</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>3 \u2013 6m` before IVF.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>Surgery:</stro